        "tab-description": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Description",
            "content": "<p>AutoLinkr Lite™ does one thing exceptionally well: it converts your existing wired CarPlay system to fully wireless. No more plugging in your phone every time you get in the car.</p><p>Plug the adapter into your car’s USB port, pair your iPhone once via Bluetooth, and from that point on CarPlay connects automatically the moment your car starts. Navigate with Apple Maps or Google Maps, take hands-free calls, use Siri, and play music through your factory speakers — all wirelessly.</p><p>Simple, reliable, and built for drivers who just want wireless CarPlay without complexity or a high price tag.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-compatibility": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Compatibility",
            "content": "<p>Requires a factory <strong>wired CarPlay</strong> system — your car must already support CarPlay via cable for this adapter to work.</p><p>Compatible with 600+ car models from 2016+: Toyota, Honda, Ford, Chevrolet, Mercedes, Hyundai, Kia, Nissan, Subaru, Mazda, Volkswagen, Audi, and 30+ more manufacturers.</p><p>iPhone 7 or later required. Android Auto also supported on compatible Android devices.</p><p>Not compatible with: Tesla, Rivian, Lucid, NIO, or vehicles without factory wired CarPlay.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/supported-cars\">Check Your Car →</a></p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-specs": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What's Included",
            "content": "<ul><li>Wireless: 5GHz WiFi + Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>Supports: Apple CarPlay (wireless), Android Auto (wireless)</li><li>Connector: USB-A plug (fits factory USB port)</li><li>Auto-connect: Yes — no phone interaction required after initial pairing</li><li>Streaming: Not supported (CarPlay &amp; navigation only)</li></ul><p>Note: AutoLinkr Lite™ does not support Google Play, Netflix, or third-party app streaming. For full streaming, see <a href=\"/products/the-autolinkr-pro\">AutoLinkr Pro™</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
